      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bloomfield_Hills%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The historic 1845 Greek Revival Farmhouse, an early pioneer Log Cabin, and an 1859 stone Schoolhouse are preserved by the Bloomfield Historical Society.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
